        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917370/extras/70240c8a1c58eb9e7c7b9323e99b7e3f.avif?t=1759291282\" width=1600 height=922 /></span>Explore, interact, and collect pizza slices in this sci-fi RPG, retro-stylized game. Help locate Mike and learn exactly what happened to him. HUMANITY IS AT STAKE! Well, kinda. Do your best to unravel the mystery while trying to keep your sanity in check. Humans are cool, but ALIENS RULE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aliens Rule is the first game in a planned series of larger releases, created by a one-person team. Enjoy the creepy, unsettling vibe while exploring and interacting with multiple NPCs. Gameplay, and puzzle-solving, is meant to be mild, experience-centered, and non-stressful. Be a part of this first-release experience to help influence the next one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Game tips available on dev website).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917370/extras/946c53239f991580a8b143e38190eae7.avif?t=1759291282\" width=1318 height=1004 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917370/extras/28508fac1a8090ff5171f596d475a04d.avif?t=1759291282\" width=1330 height=1004 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917370/extras/70240c8a1c58eb9e7c7b9323e99b7e3f.avif?t=1759291282\" width=1600 height=922 /></span>Explore, interact, and collect pizza slices in this sci-fi RPG, retro-stylized game. Help locate Mike and learn exactly what happened to him. HUMANITY IS AT STAKE! Well, kinda. Do your best to unravel the mystery while trying to keep your sanity in check. Humans are cool, but ALIENS RULE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aliens Rule is the first game in a planned series of larger releases, created by a one-person team. Enjoy the creepy, unsettling vibe while exploring and interacting with multiple NPCs. Gameplay, and puzzle-solving, is meant to be mild, experience-centered, and non-stressful. Be a part of this first-release experience to help influence the next one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Game tips available on dev website).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917370/extras/946c53239f991580a8b143e38190eae7.avif?t=1759291282\" width=1318 height=1004 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917370/extras/28508fac1a8090ff5171f596d475a04d.avif?t=1759291282\" width=1330 height=1004 /></span></p>",
        "short_description": "Your friend Mike is missing! He made pizza at the local pizza joint until his paranoia with aliens took over. Help find him in this strange, lo-fi adventure! Set in the 1990s, Aliens Rule is an indie RPG game full of conspiracy theories, mystery, NPC interaction, and lots of pizza.",
